  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1288/713/skilltree_a_1000-png.png\" alt=\"天赋树\"></p>\n<h2>⭐️ 选择你的道路 —— 塑造职业的天赋技能</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-Fabric | NeoForge-ecebe6?labelColor=263768&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"加载器\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ecosystem-Spell_Engine-orange?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"法术引擎\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/KN9b3pjFTM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/973561601519149057.svg?label=&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&color=7389D8&labelColor=6A7EC2&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>✨ 探索更多 RPG 系列内容</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/169/archers_full_275.png\" alt=\"弓箭手\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paladins-and-priests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/170/paladins_full_275.png\" alt=\"圣骑士\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wizards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/171/wizards_full_275.png\" alt=\"法师\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rogues-and-warriors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/332/rogues_full_bg_275.png\" alt=\"盗贼\"></a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jewelry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/387/jewelry_full_275.png\" alt=\"珠宝\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-rpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/296/relics_275-png.png\" alt=\"遗物\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arsenal-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/295/arsenal_full_275-png.png\" alt=\"武器库\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armory-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/866/armory_275-png.png\" alt=\"装备库\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1>📦 安装</h1>\n<h3>必需组件</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Pufferfish Skills（河豚技能）</li>\n<li>Archers（弓箭手）（RPG 系列）</li>\n<li>Paladins &amp; Priests（圣骑士与牧师）（RPG 系列）</li>\n<li>Rogues &amp; Warriors（盗贼与战士）（RPG 系列）</li>\n<li>Wizards（法师）（RPG 系列）</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>🌴 特性</h1>\n<p>为你的 RPG 系列职业探索全新的天赋树，包含 100+ 个独特节点。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>将每个职业专精于进攻或防御方向</li>\n<li>法术修饰技能节点 —— 部分技能可修改现有法术，以独特方式增强其效果</li>\n<li>被动法术技能节点 —— 部分技能为你提供被动能力，可与现有法术配合使用</li>\n</ul>\n<p>通过积累经验值来获取技能点，从而解锁技能。经验值将在队伍成员间共享。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/832/full_tree-png.png\" alt=\"天赋树\"></p>\n<h2>↔️ 有意义的抉择</h2>\n<p>本模组不提供一条让你直接变强的线性解锁路线，而是提供独特的专精选择。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/837/frost_nova-png.png\" alt=\"霜新星\"></p>\n<h2>🐣 法术修饰</h2>\n<p>部分技能选择会修改你已有的法术，从而改变你的玩法或与其他玩家的互动方式。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/839/judgement-png.png\" alt=\"审判\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/836/blood_barrage-png.png\" alt=\"鲜血弹幕\"></p>\n<h2>🌟 被动法术</h2>\n<p>获得始终伴随你的新被动法术。它们具备多种触发条件、效果及战斗联动机制。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/834/arcane_ward-png.png\" alt=\"奥术壁垒\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/833/ambush-png.png\" alt=\"伏击\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/835/blazing_speed-png.png\" alt=\"烈焰疾速\"></p>\n<h2>💔 重置天赋树</h2>\n<p>想放弃当前的构筑吗？—— 获取并使用“遗忘之球”，即可重置并退还你在天赋树上投入的所有点数。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1261/840/orb_of_oblivion_1_shadow-png.png\" alt=\"重置宝珠\"></p>\n<h1>专为多人游戏设计</h1>\n<p>创建你自己的 RPG 服务器。使用我们的优惠码可享受更低价格，同时也能为我们提供支持。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fRPG_SERIES\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/88e9c178-fe70-4122-8b9b-97d2feb48c2a.png\" alt=\"获取服务器\"></a></p>\n<h1>🎁 想要更多内容？</h1>\n<p>发现由我们亲爱的合作伙伴制作的丰富法术引擎模组！</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-minibosses-forsaken-adventurers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1358/177/anarchy-png.png\" alt=\"混沌之地\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mercenaries-and-artificers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/857/merc_275-png.png\" alt=\"雇佣兵与工匠\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/945/archers_expansion_275-png.png\" alt=\"弓箭手扩展包（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berserker-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/946/berserker_mod_275-png.png\" alt=\"狂战士（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elemental-wizards-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/947/elemental_wizards_275-png.png\" alt=\"元素法师（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forcemaster-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/948/forcemaster_275-png.png\" alt=\"劲力宗师（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/witcher-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/949/witcher_mod_275-png.png\" alt=\"猎魔人（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-knights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/953/998/death_knights_275_2.png\" alt=\"死亡骑士\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
